Error [E2501]: `write_line` is not available on a read-only file handle
  --> tests/ui/e2501_bad_handle_method.jet:5:7
    |
  5 |     h.write_line("hello")?
    |       ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `files.open` returns a read-only handle; it can only read lines or bytes
 Fix: use `files.create` or `files.append` to get a writable handle

Error [E0402]: this call can fail and nothing checks it
  --> tests/ui/e2501_bad_handle_method.jet:9:5
    |
  9 |     go()
    |     ^^
 Why: a fallible result can't be ignored — handle it or say failure is impossible
 Fix: use `?`, `??`, `panic ...`, or `.drop("reason")` to intentionally discard
